{#
| Variable     | Type                  | Description |
|--------------|-----------------------|-------------|
| page         | Page                  |             |
| page.title   | string                |             |
| page.content | string                |             |
| page.url     | string                |             |
| page.slug    | string                |             |
| page.type    | string                |             |

UNIX (ROADMAP 5.5 · DS §8.43 · D102): unix.sa main-page.liquid → the page title as the page's single h1
(at h2 size, `title--page h2`), then the merchant's content in a readable `.unix-rte` column. Server-side, like
the article (5.4): an h1 inside the content becomes h2, content images get loading="lazy", and each table is
wrapped in a keyboard-scrollable box. Salla's page comments only when unix_page_comments is on (unix.sa pages
have none). Pages built with Salla's page builder (`customised`) keep Salla's hook untouched.
#}
{% extends "layouts.master" %}
{% block content %}
    {% if page.type == 'customised' %}
      {#
          Hook: information_page.information_page
          Fires before the main informative page content section.
          Use this hook to inject custom content or components above the page content area.
      #}
      <div class="s-blocks-wrapper s-information-page !mt-0">{% hook 'information_page.information_page' %}</div>
    {% else %}
      {% set unix_content = page.content|default('')|replace({
        '&nbsp;': ' ',
        '<h1': '<h2', '<H1': '<h2', '</h1>': '</h2>', '</H1>': '</h2>',
        '<img ': '<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" ',
        '<table': '<div class="unix-rte__table" tabindex="0"><table', '</table>': '</table></div>'
      }) %}
      <div class="unix-container unix-page">
          {# add breadcumbs container in pages to make a space in case breadcrumbs is off #}
          <nav class="breadcrumbs w-full py-5">
              <salla-breadcrumb></salla-breadcrumb>
          </nav>

          <article class="unix-page__article" aria-labelledby="unix-page-title">
              <header class="unix-page__header">
                  <h1 class="unix-page__title" id="unix-page-title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
              </header>
              <div class="unix-page__content unix-rte">
                  {{ unix_content|raw }}
              </div>
          </article>

          {% if theme.settings.get('unix_page_comments', false) %}
            <div class="unix-page__comments">
              <salla-comments data-testid="store-page-comments" item-id="{{ page.id }}" type="page"></salla-comments>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
{% endblock %}
